WEBVTT

00:31.440 --> 00:34.990
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.010 --> 00:38.390
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.660 --> 00:44.630
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.790 --> 00:49.420
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.440 --> 00:52.950
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.970 --> 00:56.460
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.480 --> 00:59.990
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.010 --> 01:06.070
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.330 --> 01:23.610
Si Jin

01:23.630 --> 01:28.130
Episode 24

01:38.630 --> 01:39.610
Come here!

01:39.630 --> 01:41.070
Take shelter here.

01:44.190 --> 01:45.450
Careful.

01:45.470 --> 01:46.830
Get on.

01:50.070 --> 01:52.030
It's raining heavily.

01:52.630 --> 01:54.560
The palace gates are about to close.

01:55.630 --> 01:57.460
Are you going out?

01:57.830 --> 01:59.190
Yes.

01:59.510 --> 02:01.710
(Princess Fuqing)
Is it bustling outside?

02:01.900 --> 02:03.260
Of course.

02:03.340 --> 02:05.140
Much more so than in the Palace,

02:05.430 --> 02:07.650
especially at the Lantern Festival
in the West Market.

02:07.670 --> 02:09.320
There are all kinds of lanterns.

02:09.340 --> 02:10.700
They're amazing.

02:10.740 --> 02:13.030
Also, the fireworks

02:13.270 --> 02:14.630
are breathtaking.

02:15.790 --> 02:17.040
You have to

02:17.060 --> 02:18.550
see for yourself someday.

02:22.580 --> 02:24.070
Have you never seen them?

02:38.990 --> 02:40.880
The rain is about to stop.

02:40.900 --> 02:42.430
I'll walk you out.

02:44.460 --> 02:45.820
Uh...

02:48.020 --> 02:49.000
is it too much trouble?

02:49.020 --> 02:50.380
Not at all.

02:51.140 --> 02:52.710
Thank you then.

03:28.340 --> 03:29.900
Princess Fuqing?

03:30.180 --> 03:32.560
(Is she that princess)

03:32.580 --> 03:34.110
(who's said to have eye disease?)

03:34.110 --> 03:36.040
Your Highness! Your Highness!

03:36.060 --> 03:37.420
Your Highness,

03:37.460 --> 03:38.880
I've finally found you.

03:38.900 --> 03:40.260
Are you alright?

03:41.620 --> 03:42.990
Greetings, sir.

03:43.390 --> 03:45.460
Your Highness, I was so worried

03:45.460 --> 03:47.090
when the rain poured down just now.

03:47.110 --> 03:47.990
Please don't ever

03:47.990 --> 03:49.990
go out alone again.

03:50.230 --> 03:51.590
Your Highness.

03:52.230 --> 03:54.440
I failed to recognize you earlier.

03:54.460 --> 03:55.900
I'm sorry

03:55.990 --> 03:57.490
for my rudeness.

03:57.510 --> 03:58.690
It's fine.

03:58.710 --> 04:01.210
No one had ever said that.

04:01.230 --> 04:03.150
They had never told me

04:03.180 --> 04:05.060
about those fun things to see and do

04:05.060 --> 04:06.590
in case I became upset.

04:07.430 --> 04:08.790
Ms. Hua,

04:09.230 --> 04:11.300
he's leaving.

04:11.790 --> 04:13.630
Please walk him out for me.

04:13.910 --> 04:15.270
Yes.

04:15.380 --> 04:17.040
Let's go back, Your Highness.

04:20.910 --> 04:22.630
Good night, Your Highness.

04:35.820 --> 04:36.660
Miss!

04:36.670 --> 04:38.220
Bad news, Miss!

04:40.380 --> 04:41.720
Is Commandant Yu alright?

04:41.740 --> 04:43.650
He's fine. It's Duke An's heir.

04:43.670 --> 04:44.560
He died all of a sudden

04:44.560 --> 04:45.550
when drinking with girls.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.220
Died all of a sudden?

04:51.620 --> 04:52.840
What about Qiaoniang?

04:52.860 --> 04:53.820
I knew you'd be worried

04:53.820 --> 04:55.090
and asked about her.

04:55.110 --> 04:56.300
Everyone in Duke An's Mansion

04:56.300 --> 04:57.630
is looking forward to her baby,

04:57.630 --> 04:58.620
the sole lineal grandson

04:58.620 --> 05:00.020
of great significance.

05:00.670 --> 05:02.510
I hope Qiaoniang will be fine.

05:04.550 --> 05:06.660
Ji Chongyi died...

05:12.470 --> 05:14.630
(He had died much earlier last time.)

05:14.820 --> 05:16.300
(I thought as things changed, )

05:16.300 --> 05:17.830
(he'd live, )

05:17.940 --> 05:19.950
(but he ended up the same.)

05:20.110 --> 05:23.070
(It was probably his fate.)

05:41.350 --> 05:42.710
Smells so good!

05:55.990 --> 05:57.910
How long will it be done?

05:57.910 --> 05:59.710
In a second.

06:03.300 --> 06:04.780
Taste it, Zhan.

06:08.150 --> 06:09.010
Is it good?

06:09.030 --> 06:09.920
So rich and flavorful!

06:09.940 --> 06:11.300
I... I want more.

06:14.740 --> 06:15.770
Chief,

06:15.790 --> 06:17.440
here come noodles. Let's eat.

06:18.620 --> 06:19.980
No.

06:20.230 --> 06:21.590
No?

06:30.590 --> 06:32.710
Still waiting for Miss Si's fish soup?

06:33.230 --> 06:35.570
Mind your own business

06:35.590 --> 06:37.590
or those things in the office.

06:37.590 --> 06:39.110
Fine. I won't get between you two.

06:39.110 --> 06:40.540
I'll go once I'm done.

06:41.690 --> 06:46.210
(Fragrance Shop)

06:57.470 --> 06:59.570
Stop sighing,

06:59.590 --> 07:00.620
or you'll drive away

07:00.620 --> 07:02.590
all our clients.

07:04.820 --> 07:06.710
Qi is a rare catch.

07:06.910 --> 07:09.530
He's most reliable and charming.

07:09.550 --> 07:11.710
He and Si make a perfect match.

07:14.260 --> 07:15.620
Lift your arm.

07:16.940 --> 07:18.590
So what?

07:18.910 --> 07:20.360
My sister

07:20.380 --> 07:22.900
deserves the best man in the world.

07:24.030 --> 07:25.630
Be reasonable.

07:26.430 --> 07:28.450
In all of Ling'an,

07:28.470 --> 07:30.360
there's hardly anyone

07:30.380 --> 07:31.740
better than Qi.

07:32.590 --> 07:33.950
This side.

07:34.740 --> 07:36.460
I disagree.

07:37.180 --> 07:38.350
I think I'm

07:38.350 --> 07:39.800
as good as him

07:39.820 --> 07:41.180
if

07:41.430 --> 07:43.660
not a tad better.

07:47.060 --> 07:48.030
You...

07:48.030 --> 07:49.900
What's that supposed to mean?

07:52.820 --> 07:54.410
If you ask me,

07:54.430 --> 07:55.720
people are different.

07:55.740 --> 07:57.380
No need to compare yourself with others.

07:57.380 --> 07:59.900
Ever since he and Si became close,

08:00.740 --> 08:03.450
she's been paying
less and less attention to me.

08:03.470 --> 08:05.590
It can't go on like this!

08:07.380 --> 08:09.030
Look at you

08:09.700 --> 08:11.750
being so jealous already.

08:12.180 --> 08:13.330
When she

08:13.350 --> 08:15.590
gets married,

08:15.670 --> 08:17.340
won't you feel even worse?

08:42.300 --> 08:43.700
Yu Jin.

08:44.460 --> 08:45.940
What are you doing here?

08:46.670 --> 08:47.850
Why are you here?

08:47.870 --> 08:49.750
I'm here for something important.

08:50.540 --> 08:51.420
Speak.

08:51.430 --> 08:53.390
Aren't you going to let me in?

08:55.150 --> 08:56.150
What if I speak up,

08:56.150 --> 08:57.770
and everyone hears?

08:57.790 --> 08:59.270
I don't mind, though.

09:03.630 --> 09:05.030
The door's over there.

09:08.030 --> 09:09.470
Yu Jin.

09:10.150 --> 09:11.510
Yu Jin.

09:14.390 --> 09:16.510
Are you living in this hut?

09:16.510 --> 09:18.410
It's way beneath you.

09:18.430 --> 09:21.110
When will Uncle reinstate you as prince?

09:21.980 --> 09:23.650
I heard you two had met

09:23.670 --> 09:25.750
at the Mid-Autumn Hunt.

09:28.100 --> 09:29.540
What's your point?

09:31.300 --> 09:32.730
Yu Jin,

09:32.750 --> 09:34.180
my point is

09:34.390 --> 09:36.230
we're family.

09:36.630 --> 09:37.750
That dog bites,

09:37.750 --> 09:39.110
Yu Jin!

09:39.430 --> 09:42.150
Cui Mingyue, cut to the chase.

09:42.180 --> 09:43.540
Then get out.

09:46.790 --> 09:48.150
Yu Jin,

09:48.180 --> 09:50.180
if that's your attitude,

09:51.790 --> 09:53.390
I'll talk to Jiang Si instead.

09:53.390 --> 09:54.650
Your Grace probably forgot

09:54.670 --> 09:56.990
about my warning.

10:02.670 --> 10:04.700
I remember

10:04.750 --> 10:06.540
every word you've said.

10:06.910 --> 10:09.080
Although you're mean to me,

10:09.100 --> 10:11.270
I can't blame you.

10:11.430 --> 10:13.580
But Jiang Si is different.

10:13.940 --> 10:16.470
A humble earl's daughter

10:16.910 --> 10:19.180
is no match for the Grand Princess.

10:21.220 --> 10:22.780
If you...

10:25.670 --> 10:27.960
If you obey me,

10:27.980 --> 10:29.730
I won't give her a hard time.

10:29.750 --> 10:31.390
Can we sit down and talk now?

10:31.390 --> 10:33.080
There's nothing to talk about.

10:33.550 --> 10:35.150
Here's my only advice.

10:35.220 --> 10:37.060
Stay away from Jiang Si.

10:37.870 --> 10:41.080
Some bravado you got, Prince Jin.

10:41.100 --> 10:42.030
She still doesn't know

10:42.030 --> 10:43.990
who you really are, right?

10:44.940 --> 10:46.920
A prince is

10:46.940 --> 10:47.790
way out of the league

10:47.790 --> 10:50.060
of a powerless earl's daughter.

10:54.300 --> 10:56.320
Yu Jin, your wife

10:56.340 --> 10:58.650
should match your status,

10:58.670 --> 11:00.200
who's noble

11:00.220 --> 11:02.110
and well-connected.

11:03.030 --> 11:03.980
Although Jiang Si is

11:03.980 --> 11:05.900
good-looking

11:06.180 --> 11:08.580
and seductive as her mother,

11:08.870 --> 11:11.060
making men fall for her,

11:12.030 --> 11:14.010
you should know

11:14.030 --> 11:16.160
it's no more than a fling.

11:16.180 --> 11:17.700
You two won't make it

11:18.300 --> 11:19.990
even without me.

11:24.270 --> 11:25.630
Who's there?

11:27.750 --> 11:29.580
You should leave.

11:30.220 --> 11:31.580
At ease.

11:39.820 --> 11:42.750
Here you are being so caring and sweet.

11:43.270 --> 11:45.680
Su seduced my father the same way, huh?

11:45.700 --> 11:46.820
It was Commandant Yu

11:46.820 --> 11:48.180
who made you mad.

11:48.270 --> 11:50.150
Why vent your anger on me?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.940
You said

11:51.940 --> 11:54.300
my mother and I seduced men.

11:54.460 --> 11:55.800
Your Grace,

11:55.820 --> 11:57.560
why not try it yourself

11:57.580 --> 11:59.300
and see if it'll work?

11:59.630 --> 12:02.150
There aren't noble or dirty ways

12:02.180 --> 12:03.150
as long as they work.

12:03.150 --> 12:05.150
How shameless!

12:05.790 --> 12:07.180
You think I was complimenting you?

12:07.180 --> 12:08.680
You came alone,

12:08.700 --> 12:10.220
insisting on chatting with Mr. Yu,

12:10.220 --> 12:11.700
and threatened him to comply.

12:11.700 --> 12:13.610
Weren't you trying to seduce him?

12:13.630 --> 12:16.250
But he has no interest in you.

12:16.270 --> 12:18.130
This is the first time I've seen

12:18.150 --> 12:19.340
a girl harassing a man

12:19.340 --> 12:20.730
when he asks her to leave.

12:20.750 --> 12:22.010
A County Princess like you

12:22.030 --> 12:23.150
is indeed bolder.

12:23.170 --> 12:24.030
Clearly, a decent girl

12:24.030 --> 12:26.180
like me is not your match.

12:27.430 --> 12:29.920
Your Grace, will you leave,

12:29.940 --> 12:31.660
or shall I make you go?

12:31.980 --> 12:33.340
Stop.

12:38.790 --> 12:40.580
You're the 7th Prince.

12:43.060 --> 12:44.990
You crossed the line.

12:45.550 --> 12:47.110
Just you wait.

12:59.750 --> 13:01.220
Did you hear everything?

13:09.030 --> 13:10.940
I'd tell you later.

13:11.180 --> 13:12.980
I didn't mean to keep it from you.

13:12.980 --> 13:14.630
Behave yourself, Prince Jin.

13:16.180 --> 13:19.610
I apologize for not recognizing you

13:19.630 --> 13:21.140
and offending you before.

13:34.630 --> 13:36.390
Let's go, Aman.

13:46.100 --> 13:48.160
Yu Jin, your wife

13:48.180 --> 13:50.560
should match your status,

13:50.580 --> 13:52.040
who's noble

13:52.060 --> 13:53.990
and well-connected.

14:22.940 --> 14:24.350
Eat now.

14:25.790 --> 14:27.150
Eat it.

14:32.980 --> 14:35.060
Are you on a fast like him?

14:37.490 --> 14:38.850
You...

14:39.150 --> 14:40.630
Chief,

14:41.060 --> 14:42.550
stop splitting firewood

14:42.550 --> 14:44.150
in the middle of the night.

14:45.580 --> 14:46.610
Look,

14:46.630 --> 14:47.870
we can fight on the battlefield,

14:47.870 --> 14:49.580
but you can't do this.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.600
Stop, please.

14:53.620 --> 14:54.510
Chief, I'll help you.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.580
I'll apologize to Miss Si for you.

14:56.630 --> 14:57.990
Alright?

15:00.430 --> 15:01.790
Wait, no.

15:02.340 --> 15:03.700
Go with the ax.

15:07.270 --> 15:08.700
Is it to kill?

15:09.510 --> 15:11.220
I need you to tell her

15:11.220 --> 15:12.940
not to bottle up her anger.

15:12.940 --> 15:14.280
Vent it on me!

15:14.300 --> 15:16.160
Relax, Chief.

15:16.180 --> 15:17.270
Once she sees me,

15:17.270 --> 15:18.750
she'll know your apology

15:18.750 --> 15:20.150
is sincere.

15:20.390 --> 15:21.530
I'm on it now.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.910
Go.

15:33.390 --> 15:35.110
This stab

15:35.270 --> 15:37.510
is for my husband,

15:38.150 --> 15:39.750
Yu Qi.

15:42.060 --> 15:44.350
Why did you kill him, too?

15:46.390 --> 15:47.750
Do you think

15:48.510 --> 15:51.350
he's just that Yu Qi you know?

15:53.300 --> 15:55.130
(Turns out, Yu Qi is)

15:55.150 --> 15:57.610
(the 7th Prince, who's said to be cursed.)

15:57.630 --> 15:59.780
(He never told me about that.)

16:00.790 --> 16:02.180
(The Grand Princess, after learning)

16:02.180 --> 16:04.200
(about his identity, )

16:04.220 --> 16:06.560
(feared that he'd threaten her power.)

16:06.580 --> 16:08.770
(She deprived him of his military power)

16:08.790 --> 16:10.890
(and Chiyu Cavalry)

16:10.910 --> 16:13.700
(before declaring him dead.)

16:15.060 --> 16:16.100
(But her daughter)

16:16.100 --> 16:17.820
(was in love with Yu Qi.)

16:17.870 --> 16:19.390
(So, she kept him alive)

16:20.060 --> 16:21.780
(but caged in the Palace.)

16:30.630 --> 16:34.470
Are you still mad, Miss?

16:35.460 --> 16:38.010
I can go through that hole

16:38.030 --> 16:39.200
to see Commandant Yu,

16:39.220 --> 16:40.770
no Prince Jin,

16:40.790 --> 16:41.730
and beat him up

16:41.750 --> 16:42.920
for you.

16:42.940 --> 16:44.870
Who says I'm mad at him?

16:47.030 --> 16:48.940
Actually, I'm mad at myself.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.430
I'm mad that I

16:51.430 --> 16:53.140
knew so little about him

16:54.630 --> 16:56.780
and got kept in the dark for so long.

16:57.220 --> 16:58.820
But

16:59.350 --> 17:00.850
it hasn't been too long

17:00.870 --> 17:02.780
since you two met, right?

17:03.150 --> 17:04.520
You canceled the engagement.

17:04.540 --> 17:05.960
Then he moved in

17:05.980 --> 17:07.090
and...

17:07.110 --> 17:08.670
I feel as if

17:08.910 --> 17:10.750
it's as long as two lifetimes.

17:10.770 --> 17:14.340
♪ Looking back, I recall our first encounter ♪

17:14.360 --> 17:17.880
♪ Feelings remain but things are complicated ♪

17:17.900 --> 17:21.150
♪ Thoughts replay ♪

17:21.490 --> 17:24.560
♪ I can't make up my mind ♪

17:25.150 --> 17:28.660
♪ Can I still make it through the long night ♪

17:28.680 --> 17:32.300
♪ I fear that we'll part again ♪

17:32.320 --> 17:35.670
♪ A piercing ache lingers within ♪

17:35.670 --> 17:39.280
♪ Shattering the dreams ♪

17:39.300 --> 17:43.170
♪ How many petals fell, I count ♪

17:43.190 --> 17:46.730
♪ It equals the times I think about you ♪

17:46.750 --> 17:50.420
♪ The past fades as old dreams return ♪

17:50.420 --> 17:53.730
♪ How can I move on ♪

17:53.730 --> 17:57.600
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

17:57.620 --> 18:01.010
♪ However long the road is ♪

18:01.030 --> 18:04.770
♪ If love is strong, one will have no fear ♪

18:04.770 --> 18:11.370
♪ During my lifetime ♪

18:12.890 --> 18:15.130
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

18:23.940 --> 18:25.610
You're right, Your Highness.

18:25.630 --> 18:27.720
The Crown Prince
and Grand Princess are close.

18:27.740 --> 18:29.200
When following him last night,

18:29.220 --> 18:30.650
I found a powerful official

18:30.670 --> 18:31.720
going to her mansion

18:31.740 --> 18:33.270
with him.

18:33.340 --> 18:34.680
Who was it?

18:34.700 --> 18:35.850
I'm sorry.

18:35.870 --> 18:37.370
Crown Prince's guards saw me

18:37.390 --> 18:39.200
before I could get a good look.

18:39.220 --> 18:40.910
I had a narrow escape.

18:40.980 --> 18:43.030
That man's identity is unknown yet.

18:43.110 --> 18:44.990
Go back and rest.

18:45.150 --> 18:46.540
Thanks, Your Highness.

18:58.460 --> 18:59.820
Where's your mask?

19:01.940 --> 19:02.780
Your Highness,

19:02.790 --> 19:05.190
I must've dropped it in the fight.

19:08.780 --> 19:10.860
It was my fault. Please forgive me.

19:10.980 --> 19:12.340
Don't worry.

19:13.980 --> 19:15.370
Your Highness, I think

19:15.390 --> 19:17.230
no one saw my face.

19:22.830 --> 19:24.780
He was trained for years.

19:26.310 --> 19:27.750
What a shame.

19:34.590 --> 19:35.950
Your Highness.

19:36.180 --> 19:37.540
Bury him properly.

19:37.910 --> 19:39.920
Give his family 100 taels of silver.

19:39.940 --> 19:41.300
100 taels?

19:42.540 --> 19:44.380
He served me for years.

19:45.150 --> 19:46.860
He deserved it.

19:47.540 --> 19:49.750
I wish I wouldn't need to pay a copper

19:50.500 --> 19:52.100
as long as he lived.

19:52.590 --> 19:54.370
It's our great honor to be at your disposal,

19:54.390 --> 19:56.060
Your Highness.

19:59.460 --> 20:00.620
What's this, darling?

20:00.620 --> 20:02.020
(Everlasting Prosperity)

20:02.020 --> 20:03.390
When I went to the Palace

20:03.390 --> 20:04.920
to greet Mother earlier,

20:04.940 --> 20:06.590
I learned that Jin had returned

20:06.590 --> 20:08.440
from the South

20:08.460 --> 20:10.580
and gone to the Capital Security Office.

20:10.630 --> 20:12.330
(Princess Qi)
I took the liberty

20:12.350 --> 20:15.060
of preparing this gift for you.

20:17.110 --> 20:18.130
You know,

20:18.150 --> 20:20.060
that's really thoughtful.

20:20.310 --> 20:21.390
I was wondering

20:21.390 --> 20:23.000
how to get close to him.

20:23.020 --> 20:24.530
We haven't met for years.

20:24.630 --> 20:26.720
Mother said

20:26.740 --> 20:27.910
Father hadn't

20:27.910 --> 20:29.820
reinstated his position.

20:38.500 --> 20:39.810
Speaking of which,

20:39.830 --> 20:41.380
I'm clueless as well.

20:41.830 --> 20:43.230
Father called him back

20:43.230 --> 20:44.310
but made him work undercover

20:44.310 --> 20:46.040
in the Capital Security Office.

20:46.310 --> 20:47.710
Why?

20:48.670 --> 20:50.520
After serving in the military for so long,

20:50.540 --> 20:52.140
he has gained prestige.

20:52.180 --> 20:53.980
The Chiyu Cavalry trained by him

20:53.980 --> 20:55.580
is considered formidable.

20:55.940 --> 20:56.830
But in the past,

20:56.830 --> 20:57.980
Father seemed to

20:57.980 --> 20:59.820
forget about him.

21:00.180 --> 21:01.860
Why did he suddenly...?

21:02.700 --> 21:04.750
Maybe there are certain things

21:04.830 --> 21:06.540
that no one can do

21:07.070 --> 21:08.820
but him.

21:16.500 --> 21:18.960
Zhen Heng of Capital Security

21:18.980 --> 21:20.710
might be a tough one,

21:20.940 --> 21:22.960
but he's a scholar after all.

21:22.980 --> 21:25.030
He's incapable of harsh means.

21:25.670 --> 21:28.030
To think Father
questioned Cao Xingyu himself.

21:28.180 --> 21:29.860
Maybe

21:29.980 --> 21:32.340
that was pushed by Jin.

21:34.150 --> 21:36.370
I know little about court affairs,

21:36.390 --> 21:37.980
but you and Jin are brothers.

21:37.980 --> 21:39.890
You two are of the same mother.

21:39.910 --> 21:42.030
You're closer than others for sure.

21:42.670 --> 21:44.370
As you said,

21:44.390 --> 21:46.440
he's highly respected in the military.

21:46.460 --> 21:48.670
He can be of great help

21:48.670 --> 21:50.140
to your future plan.

21:51.430 --> 21:53.270
You have a point, darling.

21:54.590 --> 21:56.720
Father called him back secretly.

21:56.740 --> 21:57.630
That means the past

21:57.630 --> 21:58.650
is the past.

21:58.670 --> 22:00.920
Maybe he'll entrust Jin with important work.

22:01.020 --> 22:02.260
It'll do us no harm

22:02.260 --> 22:03.620
to win him over now.

22:04.500 --> 22:06.130
I have an idea.

22:06.150 --> 22:07.240
Why don't we hold

22:07.260 --> 22:10.030
a family banquet to welcome him back?

22:10.220 --> 22:12.370
I heard he didn't get married.

22:12.390 --> 22:13.670
I can invite

22:13.670 --> 22:14.800
some noble girls I know.

22:14.820 --> 22:16.680
Jin and the girls can get to know each other.

22:16.700 --> 22:19.190
What do you think?

22:20.260 --> 22:21.480
Brilliant!

22:21.500 --> 22:23.240
I can take this chance

22:23.260 --> 22:25.140
to sound my brother out

22:25.670 --> 22:29.480
and see if he's greedy for power, money,

22:29.500 --> 22:31.270
or girls.

22:33.670 --> 22:35.030
Er'niu!

22:36.110 --> 22:37.470
Er'niu!

22:40.630 --> 22:42.200
I'm counting on you.

22:42.220 --> 22:43.580
Go!

23:01.690 --> 23:05.410
(Morning Drizzle)

23:05.430 --> 23:06.790
Er'niu?

23:16.670 --> 23:17.850
Look, Miss.

23:17.870 --> 23:19.400
Bearing rods to apologize.

23:20.250 --> 23:22.090
(Qi)

23:38.310 --> 23:39.670
Jin.

23:41.110 --> 23:42.330
Jin,

23:42.350 --> 23:43.910
we're reunited.

23:44.110 --> 23:45.510
Finally!

23:47.260 --> 23:49.380
I prepared a gift for you.

23:51.390 --> 23:53.140
Thanks, Prince Qi.

23:53.220 --> 23:55.050
That's too polite of you.

23:55.070 --> 23:56.750
Call me Zhang or Brother.

23:57.910 --> 23:59.270
Brother.

24:01.980 --> 24:03.760
I didn't know you had come back

24:03.780 --> 24:05.710
or settled down in such a shack.

24:05.830 --> 24:07.330
You've suffered too much.

24:08.830 --> 24:10.250
Why don't you live with us

24:10.270 --> 24:12.330
before receiving your title and mansion?

24:12.350 --> 24:13.240
No, thanks.

24:13.260 --> 24:14.890
I'm used to

24:14.910 --> 24:16.480
living alone.

24:16.500 --> 24:17.700
I don't want to

24:17.700 --> 24:19.720
trouble you and your wife.

24:19.740 --> 24:21.580
No trouble at all.

24:21.740 --> 24:23.510
We're brothers.

24:23.780 --> 24:25.440
Fine, I won't force you

24:25.460 --> 24:27.050
if you don't want to move in.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.760
But now that you're back,

24:28.780 --> 24:30.610
we should at least get together

24:30.630 --> 24:32.190
to catch up, right?

24:32.350 --> 24:34.330
My wife has arranged a dinner banquet

24:34.350 --> 24:36.140
to welcome you home.

24:36.670 --> 24:38.100
I...

24:38.350 --> 24:40.580
That's too extravagant.

24:40.830 --> 24:42.350
I... I prefer solitude.

24:42.350 --> 24:43.710
Yu Jin,

24:45.430 --> 24:46.860
here in Ling'an,

24:47.430 --> 24:48.430
it's necessary

24:48.430 --> 24:49.950
to make connections

24:50.700 --> 24:52.950
to keep a foothold.

24:54.730 --> 24:57.410
(To the 7th Prince, Yu Jin)

24:57.910 --> 24:59.270
Thanks, Brother.

25:00.150 --> 25:01.670
I have to go to work.

25:01.670 --> 25:03.330
Please excuse me.

25:03.350 --> 25:05.130
Sure, go ahead.

25:05.150 --> 25:07.340
See you at my mansion.

25:16.350 --> 25:17.240
Chief,

25:17.260 --> 25:19.300
are you going to Prince Qi's banquet?

25:21.390 --> 25:22.860
Going there my foot!

25:23.670 --> 25:25.240
Your Highness, My Lady,

25:25.260 --> 25:26.680
invitations to tomorrow's banquet

25:26.700 --> 25:29.520
have been prepared and sent to the guests

25:29.540 --> 25:30.900
on the list.

25:32.780 --> 25:34.140
Send one to

25:34.300 --> 25:35.950
Earl Dongping's Mansion, too.

25:37.180 --> 25:38.540
Yes.

25:38.870 --> 25:40.860
Earl Dongping's Mansion?

25:41.350 --> 25:43.070
Jiang Si is well-known in town

25:43.070 --> 25:44.710
for her beauty.

25:44.830 --> 25:46.020
But she made a fuss

25:46.020 --> 25:47.370
in order not to

25:47.390 --> 25:48.960
marry Duke An's heir.

25:48.980 --> 25:50.510
Her name was impaired.

25:50.780 --> 25:52.540
I fear Jin'll mistake it,

25:52.870 --> 25:54.990
thinking we look down on him.

25:55.980 --> 25:57.540
That's fine.

25:57.980 --> 25:59.580
My biggest fear is

25:59.910 --> 26:01.290
what if

26:01.310 --> 26:02.820
he doesn't come.

26:04.260 --> 26:06.650
You two are brothers.

26:06.670 --> 26:09.190
He won't embarrass you in front of others.

26:10.910 --> 26:12.270
I hope not.

26:12.380 --> 26:14.090
(To Earl's Lineal Daughter, Jiang Si)

26:14.110 --> 26:15.470
Mother,

26:15.740 --> 26:17.440
Si shouldn't go.

26:17.460 --> 26:20.570
We're talking about Prince Qi's banquet.

26:20.590 --> 26:21.760
All the guests

26:21.780 --> 26:22.980
are leading celebrities

26:22.980 --> 26:25.130
in town.

26:25.150 --> 26:28.380
If any of them takes an interest in Si,

26:28.590 --> 26:30.810
she'll be in luck.

26:30.830 --> 26:32.350
That's exactly why

26:32.350 --> 26:33.260
I don't want her to

26:33.260 --> 26:35.000
get involved in those prominent clans.

26:35.020 --> 26:36.110
She'll suffer

26:36.110 --> 26:38.820
if she's married into one.

26:39.780 --> 26:42.760
You're worrying too much.

26:42.780 --> 26:44.720
If it were before

26:44.740 --> 26:46.440
when she was soft,

26:46.460 --> 26:49.050
she'd probably have a hard time.

26:49.070 --> 26:51.160
But ever since she almost drowned,

26:51.180 --> 26:53.330
she's become way too tough.

26:53.350 --> 26:54.670
We should be glad if she doesn't

26:54.670 --> 26:56.370
make others suffer.

26:56.390 --> 26:57.440
I'm afraid

26:57.460 --> 26:59.370
none of those clans

26:59.390 --> 27:01.300
will marry their heirs to her.

27:01.870 --> 27:02.960
Good!

27:02.980 --> 27:04.820
I won't marry her to them either!

27:06.590 --> 27:08.990
My Lady, Miss Si is here.

27:10.780 --> 27:12.140
Grandmother.

27:13.590 --> 27:14.950
Father.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.190
Aunt Xiao.

27:18.430 --> 27:19.910
Si,

27:19.940 --> 27:22.190
Fu told you about it, right?

27:22.390 --> 27:25.290
Prince Qi's Mansion sent an invitation

27:25.310 --> 27:26.850
to you to their banquet earlier.

27:26.870 --> 27:28.810
You should be dressed up.

27:28.830 --> 27:29.720
I have

27:29.740 --> 27:32.090
a set of the finest emerald jewelry.

27:32.110 --> 27:33.480
Take it when you leave.

27:33.500 --> 27:34.860
Thanks, Grandmother,

27:35.390 --> 27:36.860
but I won't

27:37.540 --> 27:39.030
go to that banquet.

27:40.350 --> 27:41.780
Even Prince Qi's Mansion

27:41.780 --> 27:43.920
isn't good enough for you?

27:43.940 --> 27:44.830
I have no desire

27:44.830 --> 27:46.610
to be married into a distinguished clan.

27:46.630 --> 27:48.440
I just want to live an ordinary life.

27:48.460 --> 27:51.920
Good! That's my daughter.

27:51.940 --> 27:53.150
Do you hear that?

27:53.150 --> 27:54.260
Given that attitude,

27:54.260 --> 27:55.830
none of those clans

27:55.830 --> 27:57.860
will choose her.

28:08.180 --> 28:09.070
I hate Long Dan!

28:09.070 --> 28:10.540
Why isn't he here yet?

28:15.540 --> 28:16.900
Aman!

28:19.180 --> 28:20.370
Aman!

28:20.390 --> 28:22.140
Stop! Stay right here!

28:22.260 --> 28:23.840
I'm not allowed to see you.

28:24.310 --> 28:25.860
Aman,

28:26.350 --> 28:28.340
come on. You're the best.

28:28.540 --> 28:30.220
Tell me how we can

28:30.220 --> 28:31.990
cheer Miss Si up.

28:32.110 --> 28:34.520
Chief's so frustrated
that he splits firewood every day.

28:34.540 --> 28:36.240
We've got more than enough for a year.

28:36.260 --> 28:37.390
He doesn't eat

28:37.390 --> 28:38.670
or sleep.

28:38.670 --> 28:40.220
He's lost tons of weight.

28:40.220 --> 28:42.100
It pains me to see him like that.

28:42.500 --> 28:43.860
I'm begging you!

28:45.150 --> 28:46.430
He lied to Miss Si.

28:46.430 --> 28:47.440
He deserves it!

28:47.460 --> 28:49.380
So do you for helping him.

29:13.260 --> 29:14.390
Chief simply made

29:14.390 --> 29:15.260
the same mistake

29:15.260 --> 29:16.810
every man makes.

29:16.830 --> 29:18.630
Why can't Miss Si let it go?

29:18.630 --> 29:19.610
What?

29:19.630 --> 29:21.000
- Long Dan!
- Listen,

29:21.020 --> 29:21.910
she's invited to

29:21.910 --> 29:23.200
Prince Qi's banquet.

29:23.220 --> 29:24.060
We'll go and see

29:24.060 --> 29:25.500
if every man is as terrible

29:25.500 --> 29:27.190
as your chief!

29:27.630 --> 29:28.990
Miss!

29:34.220 --> 29:36.240
Go ahead. We won't stop you.

29:36.260 --> 29:37.500
You said so yourself!

29:37.500 --> 29:39.950
- We'll go!
- Stop them!

29:40.590 --> 29:42.990
Aman, let's go.

29:46.700 --> 29:48.270
She... she left.

29:58.350 --> 30:01.370
Stop them, stop them, stop them!

30:01.370 --> 30:03.140
I thought you said the opposite.

30:06.690 --> 30:10.890
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

30:18.180 --> 30:19.540
Aunt.

30:20.700 --> 30:22.540
What's wrong this time?

30:26.780 --> 30:29.230
Aunt, did you hear

30:29.260 --> 30:31.220
that Jin had returned quietly

30:31.220 --> 30:33.060
from the South?

30:33.260 --> 30:34.350
He's been working undercover

30:34.350 --> 30:36.070
in the Capital Security Office.

30:36.780 --> 30:39.240
And he's brought down

30:39.260 --> 30:40.910
Earl Changxing's Mansion.

30:41.390 --> 30:43.670
Was all that Father's order?

30:44.150 --> 30:45.830
What's his attitude

30:45.830 --> 30:47.330
toward Jin?

30:47.350 --> 30:49.700
Will he pose a threat to my heirdom...?

30:49.700 --> 30:51.440
Don't panic.

30:51.460 --> 30:53.380
As the Crown Prince,

30:53.590 --> 30:55.780
you shall always remain calm.

30:56.150 --> 30:58.820
How could I remain calm, Aunt?

30:59.700 --> 31:02.200
Father's never satisfied with me.

31:02.220 --> 31:03.330
I was appointed

31:03.350 --> 31:04.390
Crown Prince

31:04.390 --> 31:05.430
simply because I was

31:05.430 --> 31:06.570
the late Empress's only son.

31:06.590 --> 31:07.430
Zhang has been

31:07.430 --> 31:09.140
challenging me over the years.

31:09.870 --> 31:10.830
Now that

31:10.830 --> 31:12.090
his brother, Jin, is back,

31:12.110 --> 31:14.650
he'll gain great help, won't he?

31:14.670 --> 31:16.270
Relax.

31:16.910 --> 31:18.830
Yu Jin returned

31:18.830 --> 31:20.410
without permission.

31:20.430 --> 31:24.100
His Majesty had to cover for him

31:24.430 --> 31:26.780
in case he was impeached.

31:28.540 --> 31:29.900
Really?

31:31.740 --> 31:33.670
Why would I lie?

31:34.220 --> 31:35.580
Be seated.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.750
But

31:40.350 --> 31:43.370
he and Prince Qi are of the same mother.

31:43.390 --> 31:46.910
He has great prestige in the Chiyu Cavalry.

31:46.980 --> 31:48.670
We have to beware of him.

31:48.910 --> 31:50.000
You're wise, Aunt.

31:50.020 --> 31:51.670
I'll be cautious.

31:52.980 --> 31:55.130
Aunt, without you,

31:55.150 --> 31:56.570
I'd be so lost!

31:56.590 --> 31:58.470
Aren't you sweet?

31:59.670 --> 32:00.570
Mother!

32:00.590 --> 32:02.990
So loud. Where are your manners?

32:03.390 --> 32:05.380
Mingyue is still young

32:05.500 --> 32:06.850
and naive.

32:06.870 --> 32:08.430
Greetings, Cousin Lang.

32:09.260 --> 32:10.620
Mother,

32:10.980 --> 32:12.330
did you hear

32:12.350 --> 32:14.180
that Prince Qi'd hold a banquet today

32:14.180 --> 32:16.340
to welcome Prince Jin back?

32:17.780 --> 32:20.100
Why the fuss?

32:20.310 --> 32:21.870
Prince Qi also invited many girls

32:21.870 --> 32:23.540
from prominent clans.

32:24.110 --> 32:25.960
That's not to welcome Prince Jin back

32:25.980 --> 32:28.140
but to choose a wife for him.

32:28.700 --> 32:30.780
Among all the princes,

32:31.220 --> 32:32.260
I've never seen Mingyue

32:32.260 --> 32:34.140
being so interested in any of them.

32:40.150 --> 32:41.580
Cousin Lang,

32:41.740 --> 32:43.100
Mother,

32:43.700 --> 32:45.680
you probably don't know.

32:45.700 --> 32:47.200
That day,

32:47.220 --> 32:49.470
after I fell into the Jinshui River,

32:49.590 --> 32:51.750
it was Prince Jin who got me out.

32:52.150 --> 32:53.510
So?

32:55.630 --> 32:56.990
So...

32:58.310 --> 32:59.860
I want him, too.

32:59.940 --> 33:01.910
Do you like Yu Jin?

33:06.150 --> 33:08.680
I always let you have your way

33:08.700 --> 33:11.140
except for being with Yu Jin.

33:12.700 --> 33:14.230
Why?

33:14.350 --> 33:16.240
You and Consort Xian are enemies,

33:16.260 --> 33:17.260
so I can't marry

33:17.260 --> 33:19.270
someone I admire?

33:19.700 --> 33:20.630
He's

33:20.630 --> 33:22.610
a cursed prince.

33:22.630 --> 33:25.060
He doesn't deserve your admiration.

33:26.070 --> 33:27.670
You're old enough

33:28.020 --> 33:30.470
to get married.

33:30.830 --> 33:32.380
I've chosen

33:32.430 --> 33:34.440
a few men for you.

33:34.460 --> 33:35.530
Let me tell you about them.

33:35.530 --> 33:36.290
Don't bother.

33:36.310 --> 33:37.860
I just want Prince Jin.

33:39.630 --> 33:40.680
Aunt,

33:40.700 --> 33:42.200
Mingyue is still a naive girl.

33:42.220 --> 33:44.410
It's normal to fall for someone.

33:44.430 --> 33:45.330
You know,

33:45.350 --> 33:46.260
Jin

33:46.260 --> 33:48.200
grew up at the border.

33:48.220 --> 33:49.850
He isn't close

33:49.870 --> 33:51.610
to Prince Qi or Consort Xian.

33:51.630 --> 33:53.370
Once he marries Mingyue,

33:53.390 --> 33:54.440
won't we gain

33:54.460 --> 33:56.430
huge support from him?

33:57.540 --> 33:59.540
How many times have I said

33:59.790 --> 34:00.830
not to involve Mingyue

34:00.830 --> 34:02.700
in power struggle?

34:02.830 --> 34:04.190
Crown Prince,

34:04.310 --> 34:05.670
have you forgotten?

34:07.230 --> 34:08.590
Sorry, Aunt.

34:08.620 --> 34:09.890
I'll keep that in mind.

34:09.910 --> 34:11.270
Guard.

34:12.350 --> 34:13.330
Yes.

34:13.350 --> 34:15.410
Watch my daughter closely

34:15.430 --> 34:17.330
before Prince Qi's banquet ends.

34:17.350 --> 34:18.730
She cannot go out.

34:18.750 --> 34:19.730
Yes.

34:19.750 --> 34:21.950
Please, Your Grace.

34:23.100 --> 34:24.830
So unfair!

34:29.790 --> 34:31.560
Aunt, Mingyue's spoiled.

34:31.580 --> 34:32.960
She didn't mean what she said.

34:32.980 --> 34:34.120
Don't take it to heart.

34:34.140 --> 34:35.850
I'll talk some sense into her.

34:45.660 --> 34:47.660
Yu Jin,

34:48.940 --> 34:51.430
the 7th Prince...

34:55.270 --> 34:56.210
Mingyue!

34:56.230 --> 34:57.440
Mingyue!

34:57.460 --> 34:58.910
There you are.

35:00.540 --> 35:01.870
Why weren't you inside

35:01.870 --> 35:03.210
to be lectured by my mother?

35:03.230 --> 35:04.590
Why did you come out?

35:05.580 --> 35:07.690
I hate to see girls' tears the most,

35:07.710 --> 35:09.540
not to mention you're my cousin.

35:09.790 --> 35:12.260
Mother is so unreasonable.

35:15.660 --> 35:17.290
I can't go out.

35:17.310 --> 35:19.470
Can you go to that banquet for me, please?

35:20.020 --> 35:21.940
Pretty please!

35:21.940 --> 35:23.310
Alright, fine.

35:23.350 --> 35:24.410
I'll go there

35:24.430 --> 35:26.220
to sabotage it for you.

35:33.330 --> 35:39.480
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

35:39.500 --> 35:41.220
With little etiquette left,

35:41.240 --> 35:42.140
even the rabble

35:42.140 --> 35:43.950
can enter Prince Qi's Mansion.

35:44.310 --> 35:45.560
Let me check

35:45.580 --> 35:47.790
if that invitation is forged.

35:47.810 --> 35:49.470
(Ji Fanghua, Duke An's 3rd Daughter)
What?

35:49.470 --> 35:50.580
Princess Qi had it

35:50.580 --> 35:52.540
sent to Miss Si.

35:54.390 --> 35:55.330
What are you doing?

35:55.350 --> 35:57.080
How dare a maid interrupt!

35:57.100 --> 35:58.500
Clearly, no one in your house

35:58.500 --> 35:59.850
has manners.

35:59.870 --> 36:00.810
I shall

36:00.830 --> 36:02.730
teach her a lesson.

36:02.750 --> 36:05.000
You're mad because I canceled the engagement

36:05.020 --> 36:06.290
with your brother

36:06.310 --> 36:07.600
and trying to take revenge.

36:07.620 --> 36:08.960
How absurd!

36:08.980 --> 36:10.520
It was my brother

36:10.540 --> 36:12.790
who abandoned you, jinx!

36:13.190 --> 36:15.430
Let bygones be bygones.

36:15.430 --> 36:18.170
(Kou Lingbo, Granddaughter
of Grand Preceptor Kou)

36:19.710 --> 36:21.100
Let me see.

36:27.350 --> 36:29.850
Princess Qi is my cousin.

36:29.870 --> 36:31.910
This doesn't match her handwriting.

36:32.230 --> 36:35.260
She is indeed suspicious.

36:38.020 --> 36:39.520
I knew it.

36:39.540 --> 36:41.730
How could a humble girl like her

36:41.750 --> 36:43.950
be invited to Prince Qi's Mansion?

36:45.190 --> 36:46.730
Forgive me if I'm ignorant,

36:46.750 --> 36:48.330
but I've never heard

36:48.350 --> 36:50.260
that the hostess would

36:50.390 --> 36:52.120
write invitations herself.

36:52.140 --> 36:52.980
That's right.

36:52.980 --> 36:54.540
Even in our humble abode,

36:54.540 --> 36:56.960
we'd have the gatehouse do such work.

36:56.980 --> 36:58.340
You...

37:01.740 --> 37:04.040
Ling... Lingbo can't be wrong.

37:04.060 --> 37:05.480
Is Princess Qi close to you

37:05.500 --> 37:06.770
or her?

37:06.790 --> 37:07.920
I don't know her,

37:07.940 --> 37:08.870
but since she sent

37:08.870 --> 37:10.250
an invitation to me,

37:10.270 --> 37:11.730
she must've had her reason.

37:11.750 --> 37:12.830
If you two insist

37:12.830 --> 37:14.390
that I can't go in,

37:14.390 --> 37:16.540
I shall explain everything to Princess Qi

37:16.750 --> 37:18.480
in case she feels insulted,

37:18.500 --> 37:20.100
thinking I have no manners.

37:22.100 --> 37:24.210
Please send in a message for me

37:24.230 --> 37:25.270
that Jiang Si

37:25.270 --> 37:27.080
is kept outside by these two girls.

37:27.100 --> 37:29.140
I'm unable to greet Princess Qi today.

37:29.270 --> 37:30.630
Yes.

37:30.790 --> 37:32.150
Wait!

37:32.390 --> 37:34.170
Go ahead then.

37:34.190 --> 37:35.550
Don't bluff!

37:35.750 --> 37:38.290
Lingbo's grandfather is Grand Preceptor Kou.

37:38.310 --> 37:40.260
Her uncle is the Vice Prime Minister

37:40.430 --> 37:42.410
while your father is a mere 5th-rank earl.

37:42.430 --> 37:43.690
If you sit with us,

37:43.710 --> 37:45.640
won't you feel inferior?

37:45.660 --> 37:47.560
So what if you're of noble birth?

37:47.580 --> 37:48.960
You sound

37:48.980 --> 37:51.330
even ruder than a boor.

37:51.350 --> 37:52.600
Aman, let's go.

37:52.620 --> 37:53.980
Yes.

37:54.610 --> 37:59.690
(Prince Qi's Mansion)

38:06.570 --> 38:09.090
(Everlasting Prosperity)

38:16.580 --> 38:17.940
Everyone,

38:17.980 --> 38:20.270
this banquet is to welcome

38:20.270 --> 38:21.870
my brother, Jin, home.

38:21.910 --> 38:23.170
Welcome back, Jin.

38:23.190 --> 38:24.670
Let's toast to his return!

38:24.690 --> 38:25.770
- Cheers.
- Hear! Hear!

38:25.790 --> 38:27.990
The Crown Prince has arrived!

38:31.940 --> 38:35.260
Greetings, Your Highness.

38:36.270 --> 38:37.440
What now?

38:37.460 --> 38:39.850
You invited all our brothers

38:39.870 --> 38:41.870
but me, huh?

38:44.310 --> 38:45.850
I'm simply having

38:45.870 --> 38:47.520
a casual dinner with my brothers.

38:47.540 --> 38:49.000
Am I not

38:49.020 --> 38:50.740
your brother?

38:50.790 --> 38:52.850
You're too busy, Your Highness.

38:52.870 --> 38:54.990
I wouldn't dare disturb you.

39:04.430 --> 39:05.410
Be seated.

39:05.430 --> 39:06.790
Sit, everyone.

39:11.230 --> 39:12.790
You're also here, Jin.

39:12.910 --> 39:14.170
Your Highness.

39:14.190 --> 39:15.040
Prince Qi,

39:15.060 --> 39:16.850
this is your fault.

39:16.870 --> 39:18.690
Why didn't you tell me?

39:18.710 --> 39:19.810
Uh...

39:19.830 --> 39:21.410
I made a lapse.

39:21.430 --> 39:23.060
Please forgive me.

39:23.710 --> 39:24.890
Jin,

39:24.910 --> 39:25.890
we're brothers.

39:25.910 --> 39:27.520
Although we've never met before,

39:27.540 --> 39:29.410
no need to be too polite.

39:29.430 --> 39:30.950
Yes, Your Highness.

39:31.830 --> 39:33.560
Knowing that you came back,

39:33.580 --> 39:34.540
I meant to

39:34.540 --> 39:36.620
go with our brothers to drink with you.

39:37.020 --> 39:38.000
But you don't

39:38.020 --> 39:40.430
have a title or a mansion yet.

39:40.500 --> 39:42.220
We don't have

39:42.310 --> 39:43.790
a place to drink.

39:46.020 --> 39:47.430
We can

39:47.910 --> 39:49.430
drink anywhere

39:49.910 --> 39:51.270
but not with anyone.

39:56.390 --> 39:58.430
You mean it's the people,

39:58.460 --> 40:01.830
not the place that matters, huh?

40:01.850 --> 40:02.710
If we fail to

40:02.710 --> 40:04.830
make Jin happy today,

40:04.910 --> 40:06.410
we'll be to blame.

40:06.430 --> 40:07.730
Am I right?

40:07.750 --> 40:09.330
- Yes, that's right.
- Yes.

40:09.350 --> 40:10.290
Let's

40:10.310 --> 40:12.430
- get plastered with Jin!
- Good.

40:12.430 --> 40:14.120
I appreciate

40:14.140 --> 40:15.560
your kindness,

40:15.580 --> 40:18.440
but I don't drink.

40:18.460 --> 40:21.920
I'll toast you with tea instead.

40:21.940 --> 40:23.520
Sorry for my negligence.

40:23.540 --> 40:25.430
Serve tea.

40:29.060 --> 40:30.210
I heard you

40:30.230 --> 40:32.470
and your Chiyu Cavalry were invincible.

40:32.870 --> 40:34.350
How could

40:34.790 --> 40:36.910
a warrior like you be afraid of a drink?

40:55.790 --> 40:57.310
Your Highness,

40:57.830 --> 41:00.480
all eight of us

41:00.500 --> 41:02.100
have finally got together.

41:02.100 --> 41:04.120
Whether we drink liquor or tea,

41:04.140 --> 41:06.040
our brotherhood remains

41:06.060 --> 41:08.260
the same as ever.

41:08.870 --> 41:10.440
If it's the same,

41:10.460 --> 41:12.220
why drink tea?

41:12.350 --> 41:13.480
What if

41:13.500 --> 41:14.350
I must see

41:14.350 --> 41:16.100
how much Ji can drink?

41:21.430 --> 41:22.790
Jin,

41:23.460 --> 41:24.830
please.

41:27.830 --> 41:30.390
If you insist on making me drink,

41:30.500 --> 41:32.260
I'll comply.

41:53.500 --> 41:56.480
Ever since I joined the Chiyu Cavalry,

41:56.500 --> 41:58.690
I've made a pledge not to drink

41:58.710 --> 42:00.310
for the sake of warfare.

42:00.790 --> 42:02.410
If I drink, I shall be

42:02.430 --> 42:05.000
punished by military law.

42:05.020 --> 42:07.520
If His Majesty got wind of this,

42:07.540 --> 42:09.740
what would he think?

42:10.310 --> 42:11.670
Never mind.

42:12.500 --> 42:15.690
I wouldn't dare disobey your order.

42:15.710 --> 42:17.740
I toast you, Lang.

42:21.310 --> 42:23.290
Are you threatening me, Yu Jin?

42:23.310 --> 42:24.700
I wouldn't dare.

42:25.270 --> 42:27.370
I'm following your order

42:27.390 --> 42:28.950
at the risk of my life.

42:31.060 --> 42:32.910
Don't take it seriously.

42:32.980 --> 42:34.350
I was joking with you.

42:34.370 --> 42:38.770
(The End of Episode 24)

42:39.220 --> 42:40.950
♪ From place to place ♪

42:40.950 --> 42:45.890
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:46.260 --> 42:48.640
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

42:48.640 --> 42:52.870
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

42:53.580 --> 42:55.980
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

42:56.000 --> 42:59.660
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

42:59.680 --> 43:03.100
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:03.250 --> 43:08.770
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:09.590 --> 43:13.270
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:13.270 --> 43:17.350
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:17.590 --> 43:19.330
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:19.350 --> 43:24.050
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:24.050 --> 43:27.620
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:27.640 --> 43:31.870
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:31.890 --> 43:33.670
♪ Time glows ♪

43:33.670 --> 43:38.210
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:38.230 --> 43:43.030
♪ And stars ♪

43:47.260 --> 43:49.790
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

43:49.810 --> 43:53.430
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

43:53.450 --> 43:56.880
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

43:56.900 --> 44:01.520
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:01.520 --> 44:05.210
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:05.230 --> 44:09.320
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:09.430 --> 44:11.250
♪ Time glows ♪

44:11.250 --> 44:15.800
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:15.820 --> 44:19.520
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:19.540 --> 44:23.700
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:23.880 --> 44:25.640
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:25.640 --> 44:30.160
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:30.160 --> 44:33.800
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:33.820 --> 44:39.490
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:41.180 --> 44:43.110
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:43.110 --> 44:50.610
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
